[2026-09-21 14:54:50 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 084]   Step 084 -- newest detached-cohort audit.
[2026-09-21 14:54:50 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 084]   The SBDB snapshot now carries the 2025-2026 discovery cohort and the
[2026-09-21 14:54:50 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 084]   fourth sednoid 2023 KQ14 ('Ammonite', Chen et al. 2025, Nat Astron 9,
[2026-09-21 14:54:50 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 084]   1438), whose longitude of perihelion falls opposite the clustered
[2026-09-21 14:54:50 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 084]   sednoids and has been widely reported as weakening the Planet Nine
[2026-09-21 14:54:50 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 084]   case.  This step measures, on the real catalogue entries:
[2026-09-21 14:54:50 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 084]   1. where Ammonite actually sits relative to the measured axis, and
[2026-09-21 14:54:50 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 084]   what removing or adding it does to the resident-sample statistics
[2026-09-21 14:54:50 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 084]   (a single-object jackknife on the cc <= 3 detached sample);
[2026-09-21 14:54:50 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 084]   2. the newest detached cohort -- every a > 150, q > 30 object whose
[2026-09-21 14:54:50 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 084]   designation year is 2025 or later -- scored against the registered
[2026-09-21 14:54:50 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 084]   P1/P2 predictions of step_054: the in-cap fraction versus the
[2026-09-21 14:54:50 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 084]   footprint-only baseline (~0.42) and the mixture prediction (0.59),
[2026-09-21 14:54:50 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 084]   and the cohort mean varpi against the frozen 95 per cent interval
[2026-09-21 14:54:50 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 084]   [17, 88] and the footprint-only mean (~10.5 deg);
[2026-09-21 14:54:50 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 084]   3. the same footprint model as steps 014/054 (designation half-month
[2026-09-21 14:54:50 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 084]   -> opposition longitude) applied to the new cohort itself, so the
[2026-09-21 14:54:50 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 084]   baseline is computed on the cohort's own discovery seasons.
[2026-09-21 14:54:50 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 084]   The 2025-26 cohort orbits are provisional (median condition code ~7-8,
[2026-09-21 14:54:50 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 084]   single- or few-opposition arcs); the audit reports them as a
[2026-09-21 14:54:50 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 084]   diagnostic read, with the secure-orbit subset (cc <= 3) broken out
[2026-09-21 14:54:50 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 084]   separately.  Ammonite is already inside the primary N = 44 sample via
[2026-09-21 14:54:50 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 084]   its 2005 precovery, so its jackknife is retrospective -- but it is the
[2026-09-21 14:54:50 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 084]   object whose addition was claimed to dissolve the clustering, which
[2026-09-21 14:54:50 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 084]   makes the with/without comparison the informative quantity.
[2026-09-21 14:54:50 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 084]   Outputs
